{"src":"id","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":222300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"id","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":11000.585757,"text":"Jika Anda pernah menonton film National Treasure, Anda mungkin berpikir peta harta karun ditulis di belakang deklarasi kemerdekaan."},{"kind":"text","t":11825.746777,"text":"If you’ve ever watched the movie National Treasure, you might think the treasure map is written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":11937.075266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":11941.71175,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11946.599610000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11951.974661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11957.700067,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11963.111098000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":11964.284799000001,"samples":17592,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":19143.539741,"text":"Coklat panas itu memenuhi standar Belgia. Jus buah mahal tetapi lezat."},{"kind":"text","t":19511.738855,"text":"That hot chocolate meets Belgian standards. Fruit juice is expensive but delicious."},{"kind":"audio","t":19604.755666,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19609.924961,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19611.885008,"samples":17864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"audio","t":19699.043715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19703.935815,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":19704.711632,"samples":12464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":30835.459868,"text":"Namun itu tidak benar, meskipun ada tulisan di belakangnya dokumen ini bukan beta harta karun"},{"kind":"text","t":31648.786674,"text":"But that’s not true; although there are inscriptions on the back, this document is not a map to a treasure."},{"kind":"audio","t":31730.496880000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31731.658041,"samples":15832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"audio","t":31826.128478000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":31831.287173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":31836.699074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31842.033076000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":31842.511478000004,"samples":9328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":43054.42875,"text":"Anda dapat juga ingin meminta saran dari pemerintah lain selain dari pemerintah Anda sendiri tetapi nasihat mereka dirancang untuk warganya"},{"kind":"text","t":43833.209041999995,"text":"You might also want to seek advice from other governments besides your own, but their guidance is designed for their own citizens."},{"kind":"audio","t":43936.193008999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43941.307465,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43947.05239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43951.9208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43957.366520999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43963.981521999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":43964.336725999994,"samples":9192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":53366.830964999994,"text":"Pulau Hong Kong merupakan asal dari nama wilayah Hong Kong dan merupakan tempat yang dianggap banyak tulis sebagai fokus utama."},{"kind":"text","t":54180.465354,"text":"Hong Kong Island is the origin of the name for the Hong Kong region and is considered by many to be the main focus."},{"kind":"audio","t":54280.360601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54282.291358999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54284.037170999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54285.675233999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":54287.393965999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54288.985299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":54289.296854,"samples":8592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":63350.016403999995,"text":"Siapapun yang akan berkendara di garis lintang tinggi atau melintasi wilayah pegunungan"},{"kind":"text","t":63846.224824,"text":"Anyone who will be driving at high latitudes or through mountainous areas"},{"kind":"audio","t":63932.088682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63937.365934999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63942.94497299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63947.513068,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":68500.53134,"text":"perlu memperhitungkan kemungkinan salju es atau suhu peku."},{"kind":"text","t":68910.323081,"text":"One must consider the possibility of ice or freezing temperatures."},{"kind":"audio","t":69006.340562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69011.429578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69016.63226299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69019.28369899999,"samples":21096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":80881.94690899999,"text":"Segregasi dan rekombinasi mengocok variasi pulak-balik antara dua kolam dengan masing-masing generasi"},{"kind":"text","t":81523.434499,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle the back-and-forth variation between the two pools in each generation"},{"kind":"audio","t":81625.927903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81630.745124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":81636.295793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81641.465988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81646.654403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":81651.130229,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":89433.981105,"text":"Istilah serangga digunakan oleh ahli entomologi dalam arti formal untuk kelompok serangga ini."},{"kind":"text","t":90206.858694,"text":"The term \"insects\" is used by entomologists in a formal sense to refer to this group of insects."},{"kind":"audio","t":90313.806295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90318.710825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90324.215564,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90329.513247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90334.78732,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":90335.147504,"samples":9560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97437.211616,"text":"Pertama, kebanyakan pengemudi memakai sepatu boot mengemudi dengan tumit dan sol yang halus dan sempit."},{"kind":"text","t":97982.35455999999,"text":"First, most drivers wear driving boots with soft, narrow heels and soles."},{"kind":"audio","t":98078.756685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98083.89133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98089.015196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98094.564145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":98094.87101999999,"samples":5728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":109710.71891899999,"text":"Pemeriksaan tersebut merupakan respon martiri atas protes anti rezim yang meluas yang dimulai pada Oktober"},{"kind":"text","t":110348.82186499999,"text":"That inspection was a martyrdom response to the widespread anti-regime protests that began in October."},{"kind":"audio","t":110451.18298099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110456.365226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110461.524211,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110467.995285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":110473.29175799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":110474.779963,"samples":14360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":121695.70417699999,"text":"Grup memadam bakaran akhirnya berhasil memadamkan api pada pukul 23.35"},{"kind":"text","t":122292.60727,"text":"The fire brigade finally managed to extinguish the fire at 23:35."},{"kind":"audio","t":122395.781034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122401.45367999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122406.674164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122411.840959,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122414.149311,"samples":19528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":132111.32833400002,"text":"Badai ke-10 dari musim badai Atlantik yang diberi nama badai subtropis ciri terbentuk di samudera Atlantik hari ini."},{"kind":"text","t":132941.649819,"text":"The 10th storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, classified as a subtropical storm, formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"audio","t":133052.62167400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133057.681501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133062.79947700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133068.23882700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133073.39407200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133078.126705,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133079.91799500003,"samples":23592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":140319.293478,"text":"Ini mengantarkan kita ke kereta, mobil, dan banyak alat transportasi lainnya."},{"kind":"text","t":140842.587252,"text":"This leads us to trains, cars, and many other modes of transportation."},{"kind":"audio","t":140941.643053,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140946.79961800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":140951.979603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140957.620161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":140957.88469600002,"samples":4528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":148678.052422,"text":"Kemasyurannya sebagai pusat kemewahan berawal dari tahun 400 sampai sekitar tahun 1100."},{"kind":"text","t":149516.667981,"text":"Its reputation as a center of luxury dates back from the 400s to around the year 1100."},{"kind":"audio","t":149623.946956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149629.072132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149634.187368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149639.653758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149645.116978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149647.31836200002,"samples":17960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":156589.54407200002,"text":"Permukaan bulan tersusun dari bebatuan dan debu. Lapisan terluar bulan dinamakan kerak."},{"kind":"text","t":157086.171225,"text":"The Moon's surface is made up of rocks and dust. The outermost layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":157179.56207900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":157181.57741600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157182.267564,"samples":23864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"audio","t":157271.687554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157276.694461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":157280.047786,"samples":25664,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":169325.85734400002,"text":"US Corps of Engineers memperkirakan bahwa curah hujan sebesar 6 inci ini mampu menerobos tanggul yang sudah rusak."},{"kind":"text","t":170063.28912600002,"text":"The US Corps of Engineers estimates that this 6 inches of rainfall is capable of breaching already damaged levees."},{"kind":"audio","t":170163.806783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170168.90314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170173.92528700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170179.324528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170184.862547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170190.21110900003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":170190.53574400002,"samples":6792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":180253.421742,"text":"Secara khusus dinyatakan bahwa kita dapat mendeteksi apakah seseorang berbohong dengan mengamati ekspresi mikronya"},{"kind":"text","t":180895.776378,"text":"It is specifically stated that we can detect whether someone is lying by observing their micro-expressions."},{"kind":"audio","t":181010.77297700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181016.0454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":181021.100127,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181026.448219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181031.599285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":181032.863794,"samples":13760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":181761.29995400002,"text":"dengan benar"},{"kind":"text","t":181912.92305,"text":"correctly"},{"kind":"audio","t":182003.14273700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":182003.470971,"samples":2632,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":189617.295847,"text":"Jangan mencoreng sisku dengan mencoret-coret atau menggoreskan grafiti di bangunan."},{"kind":"text","t":190169.90872900002,"text":"Don’t deface my building by scribbling or drawing graffiti on it."},{"kind":"audio","t":190265.68245300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190270.788749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190276.07340300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":190277.72593500002,"samples":14496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":198415.38693600002,"text":"Bunyi auman harimau tidak seperti auman singa yang suaranya penuh."},{"kind":"text","t":198939.35388900002,"text":"The roar of a tiger is not like the deep roar of a lion."},{"kind":"audio","t":199030.826034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":199035.92272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":199041.185514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":199041.497879,"samples":7296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":205304.334062,"text":"Tetapi lebih menyerupai kalimat yang kata-katanya diucapkan dengan bunyi geraman teriakan"},{"kind":"text","t":205886.57936600002,"text":"But it’s more like a sentence whose words are spoken with a growling cry."},{"kind":"audio","t":205983.92271500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":205988.87579400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":205994.122588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":205996.97142100002,"samples":22296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":217448.219327,"text":"Penelitian abad ke-20 menunjukkan bahwa ada dua variasi genetik"},{"kind":"text","t":217885.81323,"text":"20th-century research showed that there are two genetic variations"},{"kind":"audio","t":217976.941991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217981.91611000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217987.39367000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217990.22701300003,"samples":22896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":220237.272429,"text":"tersembunyi dan terungkap"},{"kind":"text","t":220416.99664300002,"text":"hidden and revealed"},{"kind":"audio","t":220497.975971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":220498.887236,"samples":14032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"close","t":232306.650304,"code":1005}]}